    <marc:datafield tag="245" ind1="0" ind2="0">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Into 90c North : Sharifah Mazlina a women&apos;s journey to the North Pole</marc:subfield>
    </marc:datafield>
    <marc:datafield tag="264" ind1=" " ind2="1">
      <marc:subfield code="c">2007</marc:subfield>
    </marc:datafield>
    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">On 17 April 2007, Sharifah Mazlina became Malaysia&apos;s first woman to reach the North Pole and effectively became the first Asian woman to reach both North and South Poles.  This 9 1/2 day expedition covered a distance of 110km form the last degree (89 degree N) till the North Pole.  This is the account of her second journey into the ice.</marc:subfield>
